(AegisAI Microservice System Architecture Specification) Tj T*
(==================================================) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. Overview) Tj T*
(AegisAI is a production-grade FastAPI microservice tailored for Data & AI Engineering workloads.) Tj T*
(It features autonomous tool calling, local open LLM inference \(Llama 3 8B, Mistral 7B\), JWT authentication,) Tj T*
(multi-role RBAC \(Admin, Analyst, Data Engineer, User\), and sliding-window rate limiting.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. Data Engineering Tool Matrix) Tj T*
(- Autonomous SQL AI Agent: Converts natural language questions into dialect-aware SQL \(PostgreSQL, Snowflake, BigQuery\), validates DDL, and generates query optimization execution plans.) Tj T*
(- AI Document & Web Researcher: Fuses uploaded CSV files, PDFs, or architectural text documents with real-time web search RAG for grounded Q&A.) Tj T*
(- Schema Guard: Validates Pydantic v2 schemas and JSON structural integrity for microservice APIs.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3. Performance Benchmarks) Tj T*
(- Sub-50ms token authentication and authorization verification.) Tj T*
(- Dual-quota sliding window rate limits: 20 Requests Per Minute \(RPM\) and 10,000 Tokens Per Minute \(TPM\).) Tj T*
(- 100% containerized deployment with multi-stage Docker build and automated CI via GitHub Actions.) Tj T*
ET
